[{"op":"set","variable":30001,"value":1920},{"op":"set","variable":30002,"value":1080},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i101"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"第二天，我为了去取行李而来到洞窟前。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"前天晚上，在这里露营了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"两顶帐篷也确实还留在那里。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那并不是我在做梦。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"好像是说给自己听一样，我不停地回忆那时候的事。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看向洞窟。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我们两个人走进了这里。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但终究还是……没有独自一人进去的心思。"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i413"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"最后束手无策的我，来到了港口。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我所乘坐的渡轮，停靠在船只停泊处。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i2"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"听到嘎啦嘎啦的声音，我不由自主地回头。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"从船上下来的，是观光游客。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"对了。"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":1795,"image":"i18201"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i411"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11108"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“去把行李箱找来。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“真正的我就在那里。”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":1795},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i2"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"鸥有说过，让我去把行李箱找来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那里有真正的她。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……那个行李箱……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在洞窟里被水流冲走的时候不见了……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就那样留在原地了吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这样的话，应该还在老地方。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"该怎么办呢。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我挠挠头。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一个人肯定是不行的。"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i84"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“野美希同学！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11718"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“!؟”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11699"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“干，干什么啊。突然叫住我。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……野美希同学。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11712"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“……那个。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11724"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“叫野美希就好……了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……不，野美希同学。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11704"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“你说吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我有一个恳求。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11731"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“说来听听。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我想调查采石场。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11699"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“什么؟؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不如说希望你能帮我。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11701"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“为什么？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“说来话长了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11780"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“别卖关子了，快说。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11777"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“边吃饭边说吧。”"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i15"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11780"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“原来如此……啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11755"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“我都说了那么多次不准去了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“抱歉。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11769"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“……唉。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11780"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“所以说，你是想要找到不见了的那个女孩子的行李箱吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"鸥在我眼前消失了这件事最终还是没能说出口。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"只是说她人不见了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11775"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“唔……但我也说过了，那一带是禁止进入的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“关于这一点能不能想想办法？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11769"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“说到底，那边甚至都不属于岛的管辖范围。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“怎么回事？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11780"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“那是……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i10242"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i12173"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“出什么事了吗？”"},{"op":"set","variable":26027,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i10243"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i12144"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“惹野美希生气了吗？你干什么了啊？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不是的。”"},{"op":"set","variable":26027,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11769"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“鹰原似乎想要调查采石场。”"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i15038"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“为什么又要调查那种地方了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11728"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“好像和他的朋友有关。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12141"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“嗯～是吗。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12162"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“好，走吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11701"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“喂喂。哪有这样说走就走的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12144"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“这不是有着充分的理由吗。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“去就完事了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11769"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“唉……真没办法。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11777"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“我也挺在意那个消失的女孩子。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11750"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“我一起过去的话，说不定还能帮你们善个后。”"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":513},{"op":"clear","layer":769},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i101"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10224"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“嘿。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15038"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“还有这样的地方啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15008"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“以前的采石场入口应该全部封堵上了才是。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15032"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“为什么唯独留下了这个洞口啊？”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i11731"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“因为这一带是私人土地。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i11709"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“所以，岛上的人没法进行管理。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“私人土地？谁的？”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i11699"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“具体我也不清楚，是被某个公司买下了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i11712"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“多半是想要开发度假村吧……现在还没有着手动工。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12159"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“呼呼呼。让人兴奋啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i11758"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“我们不是来玩的哦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12144"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“我知道。总之先进去吧。”"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":513},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i108"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i106"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15011"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“不过这个洞窟好气派啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i10241"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“有这么好的地方，似乎能吸引游客呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i11696"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“本来，公所好像是有这个打算的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i11769"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“不过实际操作起来，还得确认进洞之后的人身安全问题之类的事，要费很多工夫。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i11775"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“光靠岛上的公所，很难筹措这笔资金。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i11777"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“所以才要招商引进企业，共同进行调查。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i11769"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“然后因为企业方的行动突然缓下来之类的原因。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i11775"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“导致了如今还没着手开发的局面。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这样啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12171"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“毕竟无论岛上的人还是公所，都是慢性子呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11731"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“说起来最近几年，企业方派遣的人员好像调查了岛上的各种事项。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11696"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“说不定，差不多要着手行动了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10243"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“调查是指？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11709"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“谁知道呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11731"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“在岛上四处转悠，似乎在做些什么。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12174"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“于是，行李箱是在哪里弄丢的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我想，应该是在这附近吧……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15008"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“但是进洞还拖着行李箱啊。厉害了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是个奇怪的家伙。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15032"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“她是怎么回事，拖着行李箱进行着某种特训吗。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唉。不、不是，似乎也不是那么回事。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15017"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“嗯。是吗。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10290"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“不要咬着奇怪的点不放。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15035"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“很、很让人在意的吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i12141"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“说起来你们在洞窟前露宿了呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15008"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10267"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10265"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“孤男寡女的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，是啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15032"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10319"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i12150"},{"op":"text","speaker":"一同","text":"“……”"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i11776"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“咳咳。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10330"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“城里的孩子，就是会玩呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“没有没有没有。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不是那么回事。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“她是个奇怪的家伙。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“所以不是那么回事。”"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i11712"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“知，知道了。你不用那么尽力否认。”"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i11728"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“不是那么回事啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不是那么回事。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15038"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“那么回事是哪么回事。”"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i11718"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i11776"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15032"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“你脸红什么。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12141"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“然后，被告知要去把行李箱找来。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯。”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":513},{"op":"clear","layer":769},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":1795,"image":"i18201"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i411"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11108"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“去把行李箱找来。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“真正的我就在那里。”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":1795},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i106"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"真正的我在行李箱里？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"什么意思啊。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我想象了一下打开行李箱的瞬间，一边喊着“大变活人！”之类的台词一边跳出来的鸥。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"要是那样就厉害了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我感觉要是鸥的话，真如此也不奇怪。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11090"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“大变活人！”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i106"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哈哈。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11712"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“你、你笑什么啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“没什么。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12149"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i10315"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“我说，我们帮他不要紧吗。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12146"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“该不会其实是被甩了，然后成了跟踪狂吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i10318"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“有可能啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我听到了哦……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我记得是在这附近摔了一跤溺水的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11712"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“好危险啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“然后……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12174"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“喂，是不是那个。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11731"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唉。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊……”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":513},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i294"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15269"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这是……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不会错的。是鸥的行李箱。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"紧张感一下子散去了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"太好了。至少行李箱还在。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我所遇见的鸥，并不只是幻影或者是梦境。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"仅此而已，便令我比想象中更加安下心来。"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i10145"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“是这个吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯。不会错的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11768"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“哎呀呀。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11774"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“你们真的来这里了啊。而且还带着这样的东西。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i10140"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“你来一下。”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1280},{"op":"clear","layer":1536},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i106"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i10224"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i15037"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“怎么了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i10226"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“这个。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“好像是什么开关。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"苍一边靠近墙上的凹槽一边确认。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“开关？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i10235"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“可以按一下吗。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不，我也不知道啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12150"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“不会是陷阱吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11699"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“谁会在这种地方设置陷阱啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“好，按按看吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i10226"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“嗯……我知道了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"发出了咔嚓的声音。"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":513},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i107"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10176"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“好刺眼。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这是……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10189"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“开灯了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12150"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“是怎么回事啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"环顾被电灯照亮的洞窟内部。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"眼前有一条差不多能没到膝盖位置的小河。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11780"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“鹰原就是在这里溺水的吗。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“好像，就是这里……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不，不可能是这么小的一条河吧。再怎么说，这深度也溺不了水。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是也没看到别的比较大的水流。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那么，那又是什么呢。"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":515,"image":"i25658"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1266"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"溺水的人不是我，而是一个小男生……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"总觉得，记忆开始搞混了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说到底前些天是我第一次来这里，应该不会有可以搞混的记忆啊。"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":515},{"op":"clear","layer":259},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i107"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我重新审视一遍洞窟。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"行李箱被灯光所照着。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"毫无疑问是鸥带着的箱子。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12174"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“怎么办。打开看看吗。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这个，我可以带回家再打开吗。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12144"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“知道了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“抱歉。明明麻烦你们陪我了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15011"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“这种小事别在意。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i10115"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“我明明一直住在岛上，却不知道还有这么个地方。”"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i11728"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“鹰原。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“？”"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i11689"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“要是再有什么事，尽管开口。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“谢谢。”"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":513},{"op":"clear","layer":769},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":2},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i72"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i260"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15269"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我注视着眼前的行李箱。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我可以打开看吗。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"真正的我就在那里，吗。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"或者说，看了里面……好像就会有什么事情终结。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我有那种不安的预感。"},{"op":"clear","layer":1280},{"op":"clear","layer":1536},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i72"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唉，不打开的话什么都无法开始。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"似乎没有上锁的样子。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咔嚓一声，箱子打开了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我还在想……她之前那么拼命隐藏，到底装的会是什么。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"最上面的是……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……内衣。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这就是真正的我。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不，某种意义上来说，确实直逼核心。"},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":483,"value":["==",["v",6003],1]},{"op":"callScene","scene":164,"target":2},{"op":"goto","target":517},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":486,"value":["==",["v",6003],2]},{"op":"callScene","scene":163,"target":2},{"op":"goto","target":517},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i15467"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“你盯着什么在看呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":" “!؟” "},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15597"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“那个……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看到我手上拿着的东西，羽未瞪大了双眼。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15573"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“是女性的内衣吗。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唉。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哎，哎呀。真的是呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“为什么会在我手里啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“好神奇。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15372"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15408"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“我懂了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15381"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“我懂了～”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不是的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15387"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“不是什么。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这是真正的我……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15353"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“唉……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15378"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“那个是真正的鹰原哥……？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15585"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……（咽口水）。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“好了好了赶紧出去。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15554"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“这就出去。我也不想和你搭上关系。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"行李箱里没什么值得注意的东西。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我还以为会有标注她所在地的东西。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……嗯？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在内侧有一本书。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"是一本旧书。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"儿童向的小说。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"标题是……"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i260"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":2304,"image":"i1270"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"《胡子猫团的探险》。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"胡子猫团的探险？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这本书是……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这本书……我知道的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我曾经看过这本书。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"应该是，对了，是在小学的图书室里。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"暑假作业里，有一项是要看10本书。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"于是，我就找到了这本。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"内容我记得是一个女孩子召集伙伴去探险……然后……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"总之再看一遍吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"因为是很久以前看的，细节内容几乎全忘了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"即便如此，每当我翻过书页的时候，仍然会有一股怀念之情油然而生。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然忘记了具体的文字内容，可是依然隐约记得当初的感触。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一名叫做鸥的少女来参加了夏令营。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她无法融入其他的孩子们之中，一直都是孤身一人。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"有一天，她溜进了身为考古学者的父亲的书斋，发现了一张地图。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那是一张标示着隐藏在这座岛上的海盗船所在位置的地图。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她鼓起勇气向其他孩子们搭话。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"于是组成了胡子猫团，外出探险。"},{"op":"clear","layer":1280},{"op":"clear","layer":1536},{"op":"clear","layer":1792},{"op":"clear","layer":2304},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i72"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这是……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"差不多看了10分钟左右，我把视线从书本上移开。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“没错。”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":515,"image":"i25658"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1259"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"穿越森林的孩子们。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i104"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"围绕着篝火的露宿。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1266"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"洞窟中的探险。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这些全都是这本书上的情节。"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":515},{"op":"clear","layer":259},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":1795,"image":"i18201"},{"op":"image","layer":259,"image":"i18131"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":2304,"image":"i1239"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"标示宝藏的地图。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"危险的探险……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"海盗船。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"其中凝聚了许多孩子们向往的要素。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我也是在小学的时候看的这本书。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"现在也还记得当时的心情。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"向往着自己总有一天也要经历这样的冒险，在整个夏天，一遍又一遍地看着这本书。"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":259},{"op":"clear","layer":1795},{"op":"clear","layer":1792},{"op":"clear","layer":2304},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":1795,"image":"i18201"},{"op":"image","layer":259,"image":"i18131"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1050"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"为什么，我会觉得似乎在哪听过鸥的那些话呢。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1223"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"为什么，我会时不时觉得自己好像知晓鸥的探险呢。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1252"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"是深深陷入身临其境一般的错觉了吗。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不是别的原因。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"正是因为我在小说中读到过那次探险。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"小时候的我，把自己的感情代入在其中某个人身上，成为了胡子猫团的一员……一起经历了探险。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"所以才会记得。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这也就是说……鸥所诉说的回忆，全部和这本书上写的相同。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"恐怕不是真实发生过的。"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":259},{"op":"clear","layer":1795},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"怎么回事。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"鸥说了真正的她就在这里。"},{"op":"image","layer":259,"image":"i18126"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11306"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这样的话，鸥她……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就是这本小说的主角，那个鸥吗？"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不可能。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我的确在行李箱中找到了小说。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看到了‘小鸥’两个字。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是，谜团却越来越大了。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i72"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"搞了半天，我依然不知道鸥去了哪里。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"还有没有别的线索呢。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"能称为线索的，果然只有这本书了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我再次从头开始重新阅读。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"对了。她家……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我记得鸥……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她说过自己借住在岛边上的人家里。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在这本书里，鸥果然也是借住在主岛附近的小岛人家里的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"小岛……要说起来也的确是岛的边缘没错。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"要是鸥这名少女真实存在……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"便会真的有那座小岛和人家存在吧。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":23,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":19,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":20,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":21,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":0},{"op":"return"},{"op":"end"}]